OL,13,     Fwants him to focus on his health,
OL,14,     Fbut he just can't get the case of
OL,15,     Fthe murdered woman out of his
OL,16,     Fhead.
OL,17,G0000 Vigil
OL,18,     FWhen a crew member is found dead
OL,19,     Fon Trident nuclear submarine HMS
OL,20,     FVigil, Detective Amy Silva is
OL,21,     Fflown onboard to investigate.
